{%- comment -%}
  material-tag.liquid — Loam's first signature element, extended.

  Plain mode is unchanged: a hollow-dot caption, nothing to click. It is
  promoted to an interactive <details> only when the product actually
  carries composition or story data — never invents copy or a breakdown to
  make a product look more interactive than its data supports.

  composition renders as a segmented bar (each segment's share of the
  material) plus the same numbers as an accessible list; story is the
  "Behind the seam" provenance note. Either can be blank on its own — a
  product with only a composition metafield still gets the bar with no note
  beneath it, and vice versa.

  Native <details>/<summary> rather than a floating popover: keyboard and
  screen-reader support come for free, and the panel pushes the layout below
  it open rather than needing z-index/positioning of its own — the same
  choice already made for the mega menu and the accordion.

  Params:
    material     (string, required)  — product.metafields.custom.material
    composition  (array, optional)   — parsed custom.material_composition,
                                        e.g. [{"name": "Merino wool", "percent": 70}, ...]
    story        (string, optional)  — custom.material_story (rich text)
    compact      (boolean, optional) — default false; tightens spacing for
                                        product cards and cart lines
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign has_extra = false
  if composition != blank or story != blank
    assign has_extra = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if material == blank -%}
  {%- comment -%} Nothing to show. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- elsif has_extra -%}
  <details class="material-info{% if compact %} material-info--compact{% endif %}">
    <summary class="material-tag material-info__summary">
      <span class="material-tag__text">{{ material | escape }}</span>
      {%- render 'icon', icon: 'chevron-down', size: 12, class: 'material-info__caret' -%}
    </summary>

    <div class="material-info__panel">
      {%- if composition != blank -%}
        <ul class="material-bar" aria-hidden="true">
          {%- for part in composition limit: 4 -%}
            <li class="material-bar__segment material-bar__segment--{{ forloop.index }}" style="--pct: {{ part.percent | default: 0 }};"></li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
        <dl class="material-info__breakdown">
          {%- for part in composition limit: 4 -%}
            <dt>{{ part.name | escape }}</dt>
            <dd>{{ part.percent | default: 0 }}%</dd>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </dl>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if story != blank -%}
        <div class="material-info__story rte">{{ story }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </details>
{%- else -%}
  <p class="material-tag"><span class="material-tag__text">{{ material | escape }}</span></p>
{%- endif -%}
